  "policy": "Classic ESP32 QEMU official DEFAULT on raw M. Count positive native returns after 81600 prime samples. Round the first return up to the next completed 256-sample read. Use that request to copy the two-second processed history in P4 QEMU and enable R for subsequent AEC reads. Feed the whole FIFO through P4 Opus at 24 kb/s and decode the complete packets on the host. Both GPU readers use the full decoded audio. Count misses in the 24-case denominator."
